Package: shinybiocloader
Title: Use a Shiny Bioconductor CSS loader
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu", c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3242-0582"))
Description: Add a Bioconductor themed CSS loader to your shiny app. It
    is based on the shinycustomloader R package. Use a spinning Bioconductor
    note loader to enhance your shiny app loading screen. This package is
    intended for developer use.
